  "description": "Diagnose regressions, flaky behavior, crashes, build errors, and unclear failures with an evidence loop: reproduce, bound, hypothesize, observe, fix the cause at the narrowest correct boundary, then add a regression test. Use for any bug report or failure before patching a symptom.",
